# Accepted risks for the dev deployment in infra/. Each entry is reviewed before
# the expiry date; after it, Trivy reports the finding again and CI fails.

# AWS-0053 Public load balancer: intended. The API is the public entry point and
# the ALB security group only admits the CIDRs in var.allowed_cidrs.
AWS-0053 exp:2026-12-31

# AWS-0054 HTTP listener: the dev environment has no domain, so no ACM certificate.
# Production design: HTTPS on 443 with TLS 1.2+ and HTTP redirected (see README architecture).
AWS-0054 exp:2026-12-31

# AWS-0104 Egress 443 to 0.0.0.0/0 from tasks: needed to reach ECR, CloudWatch Logs and
# SSM without a NAT gateway. Production design: VPC interface endpoints and no public IPs.
AWS-0104 exp:2026-12-31
